# --- Client-derived material: NEVER commit. This repository is public. ---
# Tours, fixtures, golden datasets and validation outputs built from real
# client changesets stay out of git history permanently. Committed fixtures
# must be synthetic or taken from public repositories.
/private/
**/*.private.*
# Note: exclude run CONTENTS, not the directory itself — git does not
# descend into an excluded directory, so a negation under one is ignored.
docs/validation/run-*/*
# findings.md holds metrics and failure patterns only — never code excerpts.
!docs/validation/run-*/findings.md
fixtures/real/
fixtures/**/client-*

# --- Node ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.turbo/

# --- Env and local config ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Editors / OS ---
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
